title: "Cross-Examine: Execution-Grounded Verification for AI-Authored Python Changes"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Palyvos
    given-names: Stefanos
    alias: stefbuilds
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-08-29
url: "https://github.com/stefbuilds/cross-examine"
repository-code: "https://github.com/stefbuilds/cross-examine"
keywords:
  - software verification
  - AI-generated code
  - behavioral regression
  - testing
  - program analysis
abstract: >-
  Cross-Examine is an independent verification harness for AI-authored Python changes.
  It characterizes proposed behavioral claims, captures base-revision behavior, replays
  the same inputs against the head revision, searches bounded adversarial inputs, and
  aggregates executed findings with a deterministic verdict function. Model output may
  propose checks but cannot directly determine verdicts.
